#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-dependencies/attrs.xml:27
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>Attrs</application> package is a theme for the "
"<application>sphinx</application> documentation system. Although developed "
"separately, it is the default theme for sphinx."
msgstr ""
"O pacote &quot;<application>Attrs</application>&quot; é um tema para o "
"sistema de documentação &quot;<application>sphinx</application>&quot;. "
"Embora desenvolvido separadamente, é o tema padrão do &quot;Sphinx&quot;."

